    - title: "Axiom of choice (Wikipedia)"
      url: "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Axiom_of_choice"
    - title: "The Axiom of Choice (Stanford Encyclopedia of Philosophy)"
      url: "https://plato.stanford.edu/entries/axiom-choice/"
